typemoji (2.3.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Resolve duplicate tray icon issue on login across Linux desktop environments.
  * Standardize strictly on XDG Autostart specification and remove duplicate user systemd services.
  * Implement process-level mutual exclusion using QLockFile in SingleInstance to prevent startup race conditions.
  * Seamless focus and message forwarding to running instance on secondary process invocation.

 -- TypEmoji Contributors <contact@typemoji.org>  Mon, 23 Nov 2026 15:55:00 +0530

typemoji (2.3.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix multi-emoji continuous typing on Linux Wayland and X11 desktops.
  * Resolve premature window activation loss during asynchronous emoji injection.
  * Add header Pin button toggle (📌) for one-click continuous multi-emoji typing.
  * Prevent target application state loss across rapid consecutive insertions.
  * Atomic KWin script sequence numbering to avoid script ID collisions.

 -- TypEmoji Contributors <contact@typemoji.org>  Tue, 17 Nov 2026 00:30:00 +0530

typemoji (2.3.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Windows-Style Common Grouper and grid deduplication (388 base emojis).
  * Interactive live colour & skin tone selector bar with 6 swatches.
  * Direct corner triangle click and floating variation flyout.
  * Configurable global hotkeys with live key recorder in Preferences.
  * Recent and frequent history JSON export and import.
  * Curated Kaomoji library expansion to 89 expressions across 10 categories.
  * Customizable grid density (Compact, Standard, Large).

 -- TypEmoji Contributors <contact@typemoji.org>  Mon, 16 Nov 2026 20:00:00 +0530

